# Multica PR ↔ issue linking

Standing squad rule for this repo:

1. Every code PR **must** link its Multica issue.
2. Put `LCOW-N` (or the workspace issue key) in the **PR title**.
3. Put `Closes LCOW-N` in the **PR body** (closing keyword immediately adjacent to the key).
4. Prefer the key in the **branch name** as well.
5. If Multica `issue pull-requests` would show nothing for the issue, **do not open/merge** until the link contract is satisfied in title/body/branch — and escalate if GitHub→Multica webhook/integration is missing (repo hooks empty ≠ agent can invent a link).

See `.github/pull_request_template.md` and `CONTRIBUTING.md`.
